            "action_name": {
              "value": "Heliotrope"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(aura, evocation, light, primal)\n\nThe sunflower leshy reflects the sun or another source of bright light from their face. Each creature that ends its turn in a 20-foot emanation must attempt a DC 16 Will save.\n\nSuccess: The creature is unaffected and is temporarily immune to heliotrope for 24 hours.\nFailure: The creature is distracted by the light, becoming flat-footed for 1 round.\nCritical Failure: As failure, but the creature is also dazzled for 1 round."
            },
